      "text": "Sosias enters, leading two dogs. It seems that one, Labes (Λάβης ‘Grabber’), has\nwolfed a whole cheese. It is decided that the other dog should charge him with theft.\nBdelykleon orders the slaves to clear the ‘courtroom’ and asks for ritual prayers.",
